{"step_index":123,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T12:00:13Z","input_tokens":10613,"cache_read_tokens":139107,"output_tokens":12694,"thinking":"Constructing the initial HTML, CSS, and potentially JavaScript files is the immediate next step. These foundational files will serve as the core of the application's user interface and styling, providing the visual presentation. The development environment necessitates establishing the basic structure before further feature implementation.\n\n\nAnalyzing UI components within the HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files reveals the application's structure. The interface includes navigation with step controls, a code display area with execution highlighting and scope indicators, and a teaching area with an expression evaluator.  The evaluator, mimicking Thonny, will demonstrate sub-expression evaluation.\n\n\nThe expression evaluator needs to support step-by-step evaluation of expressions, demonstrating how sub-expressions are reduced. It will also track and visualize variable scopes, differentiating between local and global scopes using distinct cards. The evaluation process includes features like short-circuiting and value updates displayed alongside the code.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Teach Me This Code — Thonny-Style Visual Execution & Memory Model</title>\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Clean, Simple Top Navigation Bar -->\n  <header class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"brand-area\">\n      <span class=\"teacher-badge\">Teach Me This Code</span>\n      <span id=\"stepProgressLabel\" class=\"step-progress-label\">Step 1 of 50</span>\n      <span id=\"activeScopeBadge\" class=\"scope-pill scope-global\">GLOBAL SCOPE</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Simple Navigation Controls + Thonny Sub-Expression Stepper -->\n    <nav class=\"nav-controls\" aria-label=\"Step Navigation\">\n      <button id=\"btnPrev\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Go back one step (Left Arrow)\">← Previous</button>\n      <button id=\"btnSubStep\" class=\"btn-nav btn-substep\" title=\"Step through internal sub-expressions on this line (F7)\">🔍 Sub-Expr (F7)</button>\n      <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn-nav btn-next-prominent\" title=\"Explain the next step (Right Arrow)\">Next Step →</button>\n      <button id=\"btnAutoPlay\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Automatically step through the code\">▶ Auto Play</button>\n      <button id=\"btnRestart\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Start over from Step 1\">↺ Restart</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"secondary-actions\">\n      <button id=\"btnToggleCustom\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Change Input / Code</button>\n      <button id=\"btnToggleAdvanced\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Advanced View</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Optional Collapsible Bar for Custom Code / Input Playground -->\n  <section id=\"customInputDrawer\" class=\"custom-drawer hidden\">\n    <div class=\"custom-drawer-inner\">\n      <div class=\"drawer-group\">\n        <label class=\"drawer-label\" for=\"presetSelect\">Example:</label>\n        <select id=\"presetSelect\" class=\"drawer-select\"></select>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"drawer-group\">\n        <label class=\"drawer-label\" for=\"inputPlaygroundField\">Input List:</label>\n        <input id=\"inputPlaygroundField\" type=\"text\" class=\"drawer-input\" value=\"nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]\" spellcheck=\"false\" />\n        <button id=\"btnRunInput\" class=\"btn-small-primary\">Apply</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"drawer-group\">\n        <button class=\"chip-input\" data-input=\"nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]\">Kadane Default (→ 6)</button>\n        <button class=\"chip-input\" data-input=\"arr = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13], target = 7\">Binary Search (→ 3)</button>\n        <button class=\"chip-input\" data-input=\"nums = [1, 2, 3, 4]\">All Positive (→ 10)</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"drawer-group\">\n        <button id=\"btnEditCode\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Edit Python Code</button>\n        <button id=\"btnAnalyzeCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary hidden\">Run Edited Code</button>\n        <button id=\"btnReset\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Reset Default</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"validationBanner\" class=\"validation-banner hidden\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Simple Overview Banner -->\n  <div class=\"overview-strip\">\n    <span class=\"overview-label\">Goal:</span>\n    <span id=\"overviewText\">This code finds the largest sum you can get from a continuous section of the list.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================\n       MAIN 3-AREA THONNY-STYLE WORKSPACE\n       1. Your Code (Left)\n       2. Step-by-Step Teaching & Sub-Expression Evaluator (Center)\n       3. Scope Isolation & Stack/Heap Reference Visualizer (Right)\n       ========================================================= -->\n  <main class=\"three-area-workspace\">\n\n    <!-- AREA 1: YOUR CODE (LEFT) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-code\" aria-label=\"Your Code\">\n      <div class=\"area-header-row\">\n        <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Your Code</h2>\n        <span id=\"codeScopeIndicator\" class=\"code-scope-tag\">Scope: Global</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"codeLinesContainer\" class=\"code-view\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Optional Code Editor Textarea when user clicks \"Edit Python Code\" -->\n      <div id=\"liveEditorWrap\" class=\"live-editor-wrap hidden\">\n        <textarea id=\"codeTextarea\" class=\"code-textarea\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREA 2: TEACHING AREA & THONNY EXPRESSION STEPPER (CENTER) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-teaching\" aria-label=\"Step-by-Step Explanation\">\n      <div class=\"teaching-card-inner\">\n\n        <!-- Step Heading -->\n        <div class=\"teach-header-row\">\n          <h1 id=\"teachStepTitle\" class=\"teach-step-title\">Step 1: Create the variable</h1>\n          <span id=\"teachScopeBadge\" class=\"scope-pill scope-global\">GLOBAL SCOPE</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Current Code Line Box -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">Code:</div>\n          <div id=\"teachCodeBox\" class=\"teach-code-box\">c = 0</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- TASK 2.1, 2.2, 2.3: THONNY-STYLE STEP-BY-STEP SUB-EXPRESSION EVALUATOR -->\n        <div id=\"thonnyExprBox\" class=\"thonny-expr-card\">\n          <div class=\"thonny-expr-header\">\n            <span class=\"thonny-badge\">Thonny Expression Evaluator</span>\n            <span id=\"thonnySubStepCounter\" class=\"thonny-subcounter\">Evaluation 1 of 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyLiveCode\" class=\"thonny-live-code\"></div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyFocusNote\" class=\"thonny-focus-note\"></div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyTrailChips\" class=\"thonny-trail-chips\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step Calculation Breakdown (Shown on arithmetic / condition / loop steps) -->\n        <div id=\"teachCalculationBox\" class=\"teach-calc-box hidden\">\n          <div id=\"calcCurrentNumRow\" class=\"calc-row hidden\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Current number:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcCurrentNumVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Before:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcBeforeVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Calculation:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcFormulaVal\" class=\"calc-val calc-highlight\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">After:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcAfterVal\" class=\"calc-val calc-after\"></code>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- What does this mean? -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">What does this mean?</div>\n          <p id=\"teachMeaningText\" class=\"teach-meaning-text\"></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Variable values now -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">Variable values now:</div>\n          <div id=\"teachVarsNowBox\" class=\"teach-vars-now\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- What happens next? -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section teach-next-box\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">What happens next?</div>\n          <p id=\"teachNextText\" class=\"teach-next-text\"></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Final Answer Celebration Banner (Shown on final return step) -->\n        <div id=\"finalAnswerBanner\" class=\"final-answer-banner hidden\">\n          <div id=\"finalAnswerHeading\" class=\"final-answer-heading\">Final answer: 6</div>\n          <div id=\"finalAnswerDetail\" class=\"final-answer-detail\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREA 3: SCOPE ISOLATION & STACK/HEAP MEMORY VISUALIZER (RIGHT) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-variables\" aria-label=\"Scopes and Memory Reference Model\">\n      <div class=\"area-header-row\">\n        <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Scopes & Memory Model</h2>\n        <span class=\"ref-legend-pill\" title=\"Python variables store memory addresses pointing to Heap objects\">Name → @Addr → Value</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- TASK 4.1 & 4.2: ISOLATED STACK SCOPES (GLOBAL vs. LOCAL) -->\n      <div class=\"memory-section-block\">\n        <div class=\"memory-section-title\">1. Stack Frames (Global vs. Local Scope Isolation)</div>\n        <div id=\"scopeFramesContainer\" class=\"scope-frames-container\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- TASK 3.1, 3.2 & 3.3: HEAP MEMORY OBJECTS + VISUAL GARBAGE COLLECTION -->\n      <div class=\"memory-section-block\">\n        <div class=\"heap-header-row\">\n          <span class=\"memory-section-title\">2. Heap Memory (@Address → Object Value)</span>\n          <button id=\"btnToggleGC\" class=\"btn-gc-toggle\" title=\"Toggle unreferenced / garbage-collected objects from earlier loop steps\">\n            Show GC'd (0)\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"heapObjectsContainer\" class=\"heap-objects-container\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Clean Visual List Box for `nums` / `arr` showing pointers (i, left, mid, right) -->\n      <div id=\"visualListsContainer\" class=\"visual-list-wrap\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Fallback compact table for legacy compatibility -->\n      <table class=\"simple-var-table hidden\" aria-label=\"Current Variable Values\">\n        <tbody id=\"varInspectorTbody\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================\n       OPTIONAL ADVANCED VIEW DRAWER (Hidden by Default)\n       ========================================================= -->\n  <section id=\"advancedViewPanel\" class=\"advanced-drawer hidden\" aria-label=\"Advanced Debugging View\">\n    <div class=\"advanced-header\">\n      <strong>Advanced Debugging Details</strong>\n      <span id=\"advMetadataLabel\" class=\"adv-meta\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"advanced-grid\">\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Technical Explanation</div>\n        <div id=\"advTechnicalText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Python Symbols on This Line</div>\n        <div id=\"advSymbolsText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Variables Before → After (With Addresses & Types)</div>\n        <div id=\"advFullVarsText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Execution Flowchart</div>\n        <div id=\"flowchartSvgWrap\" class=\"adv-flowchart\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <script src=\"engine.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"explainer.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create app_build/index.html with Thonny Sub-Expression Evaluator, Global/Local Scope Isolation, and Stack/Heap Reference Visualizer with Visual GC","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app_build\\index.html","toolAction":"Creating app_build/index.html","toolSummary":"Create app_build/index.html"}},{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":":root {\n  --bg-page: #f8fafc;\n  --bg-card: #ffffff;\n  --bg-subtle: #f1f5f9;\n  --bg-code: #f8fafc;\n\n  --border-light: #e2e8f0;\n  --border-medium: #cbd5e1;\n\n  --text-main: #0f172a;\n  --text-secondary: #475569;\n  --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n\n  --primary-blue: #2563eb;\n  --primary-blue-hover: #1d4ed8;\n  --primary-blue-soft: #eff6ff;\n  --primary-blue-border: #93c5fd;\n\n  --local-purple: #7c3aed;\n  --local-purple-soft: #f5f3ff;\n  --local-purple-border: #c4b5fd;\n\n  --global-teal: #0d9488;\n  --global-teal-soft: #f0fdfa;\n  --global-teal-border: #99f6e4;\n\n  --addr-amber-bg: #fffbeb;\n  --addr-amber-border: #fcd34d;\n  --addr-amber-text: #b45309;\n\n  --changed-green-bg: #ecfdf5;\n  --changed-green-border: #6ee7b7;\n  --changed-green-text: #065f46;\n\n  --current-line-bg: #dbeafe;\n  --current-line-border: #2563eb;\n\n  /* Light-theme syntax colors */\n  --syn-kw: #7c3aed;\n  --syn-bi: #0284c7;\n  --syn-str: #059669;\n  --syn-num: #d97706;\n  --syn-com: #94a3b8;\n\n  --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', Consolas, monospace;\n\n  --radius-sm: 8px;\n  --radius-md: 12px;\n  --radius-lg: 16px;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background-color: var(--bg-page);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   TOP NAVIGATION BAR\n   ========================================================= */\n.top-bar {\n  height: 68px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-card);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 0 28px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 20;\n}\n\n.brand-area {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.teacher-badge {\n  font-size: 17px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n}\n\n.step-progress-label {\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n  background: var(--primary-blue-soft);\n  border: 1px solid var(--primary-blue-border);\n  padding: 4px 12px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n/* Scope Pills (Global vs. Local) */\n.scope-pill {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.scope-global {\n  background: var(--global-teal-soft);\n  color: var(--global-teal);\n  border: 1px solid var(--global-teal-border);\n}\n\n.scope-local {\n  background: var(--local-purple-soft);\n  color: var(--local-purple);\n  border: 1px solid var(--local-purple-border);\n}\n\n.nav-controls {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-nav {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 8px 15px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-nav:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border-color: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n.btn-nav:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n.btn-substep {\n  background: #fffbeb;\n  border-color: #fcd34d;\n  color: #92400e;\n}\n\n.btn-substep:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #fef3c7;\n  border-color: #f59e0b;\n}\n\n.btn-next-prominent {\n  background: var(--primary-blue);\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 9px 22px;\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);\n}\n\n.btn-next-prominent:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--primary-blue-hover);\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue-hover);\n}\n\n.secondary-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-subtle {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  padding: 7px 12px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.btn-subtle:hover,\n.btn-subtle.active {\n  background: #e2e8f0;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.btn-small-primary {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 7px 14px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: none;\n  background: var(--primary-blue);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   OPTIONAL CUSTOM INPUT / CODE DRAWER\n   ========================================================= */\n.custom-drawer {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 10px 28px;\n}\n\n.custom-drawer-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.drawer-group {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.drawer-label {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.drawer-select,\n.drawer-input {\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.drawer-input {\n  width: 280px;\n}\n\n.chip-input {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  padding: 5px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.chip-input:hover {\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n}\n\n.validation-banner {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  background: #fef2f2;\n  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n  color: #b91c1c;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   SIMPLE OVERVIEW BANNER\n   ========================================================= */\n.overview-strip {\n  background: var(--primary-blue-soft);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #dbeafe;\n  padding: 10px 28px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: #1e3a8a;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.overview-label {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  background: #2563eb;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   MAIN 3-AREA WORKSPACE\n   ========================================================= */\n.three-area-workspace {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.35fr 1.05fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n  padding: 22px 28px;\n  max-width: 1620px;\n  width: 100%;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.area-card {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);\n}\n\n.area-header-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  padding-bottom: 10px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n}\n\n.area-heading {\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.code-scope-tag,\n.ref-legend-pill {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   AREA 1: YOUR CODE (LEFT)\n   ========================================================= */\n.code-view {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  line-height: 1.85;\n  background: var(--bg-code);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 12px 0;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n}\n\n.code-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 2px 14px 2px 0;\n  border-left: 4px solid transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: opacity 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.code-row.is-dimmed {\n  opacity: 0.58;\n}\n\n.code-row.is-dimmed:hover {\n  opacity: 0.9;\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n}\n\n.code-row.is-current-line {\n  opacity: 1;\n  background-color: var(--current-line-bg);\n  border-left-color: var(--current-line-border);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.code-gutter {\n  width: 44px;\n  text-align: right;\n  padding-right: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  user-select: none;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.is-current-line .code-gutter {\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.code-syntax {\n  white-space: pre;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.syn-kw { color: var(--syn-kw); font-weight: 600; }\n.syn-bi { color: var(--syn-bi); }\n.syn-str { color: var(--syn-str); }\n.syn-num { color: var(--syn-num); }\n.syn-com { color: var(--syn-com); font-style: italic; }\n\n.live-editor-wrap {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.code-textarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 340px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  padding: 14px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--primary-blue);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   AREA 2: TEACHING AREA & THONNY EXPRESSION STEPPER (CENTER)\n   ========================================================= */\n.area-teaching {\n  border: 2px solid var(--primary-blue-border);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.06);\n}\n\n.teaching-card-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 18px;\n}\n\n.teach-header-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.teach-step-title {\n  font-size: 21px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n.teach-section {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.teach-label {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.teach-code-box {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 15.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-blue);\n  padding: 11px 16px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n/* Thonny-Style Step-by-Step Expression Evaluator Box */\n.thonny-expr-card {\n  background: #fffbeb;\n  border: 1px solid #fde68a;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.thonny-expr-card.is-short-circuited {\n  background: #fef2f2;\n  border-color: #fecaca;\n}\n\n.thonny-expr-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.thonny-badge {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: #b45309;\n}\n\n.thonny-subcounter {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #92400e;\n  background: #fef3c7;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n.thonny-live-code {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1.5px solid #f59e0b;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.thonny-focus-note {\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  color: #78350f;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.thonny-trail-chips {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.thonny-chip {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  padding: 3px 9px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid #fcd34d;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #78350f;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.12s ease;\n}\n\n.thonny-chip.is-active-substep {\n  background: #f59e0b;\n  border-color: #d97706;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.thonny-chip.is-sc-chip {\n  border-color: #ef4444;\n  background: #fee2e2;\n  color: #991b1b;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.thonny-arrow {\n  color: #d97706;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n/* Step Calculation Breakdown Box */\n.teach-calc-box {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 13px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 7px;\n}\n\n.calc-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n}\n\n.calc-label {\n  width: 125px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.calc-val {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 3px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.calc-highlight {\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  border-color: #bfdbfe;\n  color: #1d4ed8;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.calc-after {\n  background: var(--changed-green-bg);\n  border-color: var(--changed-green-border);\n  color: var(--changed-green-text);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.teach-meaning-text {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.teach-meaning-text code,\n.teach-next-text code,\n.final-answer-detail code,\n.thonny-focus-note code {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  color: #1e40af;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.teach-vars-now {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  background: var(--changed-green-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--changed-green-border);\n  color: var(--changed-green-text);\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n.teach-next-box {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  padding: 11px 15px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n}\n\n.teach-next-text {\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n/* Final Answer Banner */\n.final-answer-banner {\n  background: #ecfdf5;\n  border: 2px solid #10b981;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 16px 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.final-answer-heading {\n  font-size: 21px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: #065f46;\n}\n\n.final-answer-detail {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: #047857;\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   AREA 3: SCOPE ISOLATION & STACK/HEAP MEMORY MODEL (RIGHT)\n   ========================================================= */\n.memory-section-block {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.memory-section-title {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.scope-frames-container {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.scope-frame-card {\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--border-medium);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.scope-frame-card.is-local-scope {\n  border-color: var(--local-purple-border);\n}\n\n.scope-frame-card.is-global-scope {\n  border-color: var(--global-teal-border);\n}\n\n.scope-frame-card.is-inactive-scope {\n  opacity: 0.78;\n}\n\n.scope-frame-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 7px 12px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.is-local-scope .scope-frame-header {\n  background: var(--local-purple-soft);\n  color: var(--local-purple);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--local-purple-border);\n}\n\n.is-global-scope .scope-frame-header {\n  background: var(--global-teal-soft);\n  color: var(--global-teal);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--global-teal-border);\n}\n\n.scope-active-tag {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);\n}\n\n.scope-vars-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n.scope-var-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1.1fr;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.scope-var-row:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.scope-var-row.var-row-changed {\n  background: var(--changed-green-bg);\n}\n\n.var-name-cell {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.ref-arrow-badge {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--addr-amber-text);\n  background: var(--addr-amber-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--addr-amber-border);\n  padding: 2px 7px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n.var-val-preview {\n  text-align: right;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.changed-pill {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: #10b981;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n/* Heap Memory Objects & Visual Garbage Collection */\n.heap-header-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-gc-toggle {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.btn-gc-toggle.active {\n  background: #fee2e2;\n  border-color: #fca5a5;\n  color: #991b1b;\n}\n\n.heap-objects-container {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 7px;\n}\n\n.heap-obj-card {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 8px;\n  padding: 8px 11px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.heap-obj-card.is-heap-highlighted {\n  background: var(--changed-green-bg);\n  border-color: var(--changed-green-border);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);\n}\n\n/* Task 3.3: Visually dimmed unreferenced / GC'd heap objects */\n.heap-obj-card.is-gc-unreferenced {\n  opacity: 0.48;\n  border-style: dashed;\n  background: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.heap-left {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 7px;\n}\n\n.heap-addr-tag {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--addr-amber-text);\n  background: var(--addr-amber-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--addr-amber-border);\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n}\n\n.heap-type-tag {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n  background: var(--primary-blue-soft);\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.heap-val-text {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.heap-ref-badge {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 1px 7px;\n  border-radius: 99px;\n}\n\n.heap-ref-badge.is-gc-badge {\n  color: #b91c1c;\n  background: #fef2f2;\n  border-color: #fecaca;\n}\n\n/* Clean Input List Display */\n.visual-list-wrap {\n  margin-top: 14px;\n}\n\n.list-card-title {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.list-cells {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.list-item-cell {\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  min-width: 40px;\n  padding: 5px 7px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.list-item-cell.is-active-num {\n  background: var(--current-line-bg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--primary-blue);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.cell-idx {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.cell-val {\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n/* =========================================================\n   OPTIONAL ADVANCED VIEW DRAWER (BOTTOM)\n   ========================================================= */\n.advanced-drawer {\n  margin: 0 28px 28px 28px;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.advanced-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n}\n\n.adv-meta {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.advanced-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.adv-box {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 12px;\n}\n\n.adv-title {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.adv-body {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.adv-flowchart {\n  max-height: 240px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.hidden {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 1180px) {\n  .three-area-workspace {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .advanced-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  }\n}\n","Description":"Create app_build/styles.css with styles for Thonny sub-expression evaluator, Global/Local scope cards, and Stack/Heap Reference Visualizer with Visual GC","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app_build\\styles.css","toolAction":"Creating app_build/styles.css","toolSummary":"Create app_build/styles.css"}}]}
